  "history": {
    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "He Feng Yang lists Blood Sea’s nine true inheritances and names blood qi Gu among them, beside blood skull Gu, blood handprint Gu, blood sweat Gu, and the rest, ending with rank six Immortal Gu blood deity.",
        "chapters": [
          407
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "intro",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "char_he_feng_yang",
          "loc_blood_sea",
          "gu_demonic_blood_skull_gu",
          "gu_blood_handprint_gu",
          "gu_blood_sweat_gu",
          "sys_immortal_gu"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Giant Sun Immortal Venerable’s later recount of the same nine again includes blood qi Gu.",
        "chapters": [
          2246
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "intro",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "char_giant_sun_immortal_venerable"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Demon Immortal Qi Jue seizes a Blood Sea true inheritance exposed by a qi tide in Western Desert. He calls the blood qi Immortal Gu really suitable for him, and the text treats that Gu as a qi path Immortal Gu that further raises his strength because his killer moves consume qi path immortal materials.",
        "chapters": [
          2014
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "western-desert-true-inheritance",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "char_demon_immortal_qi_jue",
          "inh_blood_sea_true_inheritance",
          "reg_western_desert"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "A later summary states Blood qi Immortal Gu, which Demon Immortal Qi Jue seized in Western Desert, was one of the Blood Sea true inheritances, with traces exposed by qi tides.",
        "chapters": [
          2067
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "western-desert-true-inheritance",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "Western Desert’s blood qi Immortal Gu true inheritance is credited to Demon Immortal Qi Jue.",
        "chapters": [
          2246
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "western-desert-true-inheritance",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "Blood qi Immortal Gu is also in Fang Yuan’s hands. Demon Immortal Qi Jue obtained the true inheritance and transacted the Immortal Gu recipe with Fang Yuan. After Demon Immortal Qi Jue died, Fang Yuan refined it. At that point it is only rank six.",
        "chapters": [
          2252
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "fang-yuans-copy",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "char_fang_yuan",
          "sys_gu_recipe"
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
